0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           特征关键词：\n          </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: bold;\">\n           深色莓果核果+红糖+熟普感+甜菜根\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(171, 25, 66);text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(171, 25, 66);text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RdCSII0CcFSqCUP0RnKE5icMxJiaZibZzGEE9J7icU4YhBkmGcV4nlazMTsOpo8wIS1juBiccHNGIPU6g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Kiambu，位于Muranga下面，与Thika相邻；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             关于Gitwe\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n              合作社与\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               Karinga\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n              处理厂\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Gitwe合作社成立于1995年，下属3个处理厂，分别是Karinga, Karatu和Kibiru，总部位于Karatu处理厂；Gitwe合作社 总注册农户数1500户+，其中有近700多户小农提交咖啡果给Karatu处理厂；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjDH89n2MV9185IoNiawLrJCSrl7ic6escKWvmE5vK0meSGw8QBdtLlLalBMg2hP117KaBic4PZgwdw/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             Karatu处理厂成立于 1965年，与Karinga处理厂同隶属于 Gitwe Farmer Co-operative Society Ltd。主要种植品种是SL28/SL34，少量种植Ruiru11；\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjDH89n2MV9185IoNiawLrJHAM6qBZjZL9K59qm2g0mTs4icYbLV0sWJtpsFRxczvgmH6cvTSrZhpA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           关于 SL / Ruiru11 / Batian\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n           注：以下内容翻译自Sucafina\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n           https://sucafina.com/na/news/think-you-know-kenya-coffee-varieties-think-again , 品种信息部分内容来自world coffee research\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           SL的全称是\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            Scott Agricultural Laboratories (SAL)\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            ，是由当时英国殖民政府于1903年成立的农业研究机构，这个机构研究发布了现在我们耳熟能详的两个肯尼亚品种SL28和SL34；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           SL28和SL34仅是SAL在1930-1940年代发布\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           的众多品种中的两个。由于具有深根特性，能最大限度利用稀缺水资源且无需灌溉即可茁壮成长，它们很快成为种植者的首选，替代了早期的波旁品种；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           SL品种很快遍布肯尼亚全境，尽管比波旁品种更抗咖啡叶锈病（CLR, Coffee Leaf Rust）和咖啡浆果病（CBD, Coffee Berry Disease），但SL品种仍易感这些疾病。随着咖啡产业发展，许多农场面临越来越严重的CLR和CBD疫情困扰。由于肯尼亚每年逢采收季必逢雨季，CBD侵袭成熟咖啡果的问题尤为严重。当肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI, Coffee Research Institute，肯尼亚独立后成立的咖啡研究组织接替SAL，地点在Ruiru镇）于\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           1985年推出Ruiru11品种\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           时，咖啡产业已做好变革准备。这种卡蒂姆与SL品种的杂交体兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，且种植密度远高于SL品种，能高效利用小面积土地。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Ruiru11逐渐在肯尼亚咖啡种植区推广开来。唯一的问题是浅根特性使其耐旱性较差，需要更精细的施肥方案。农民后来发现，通过将Ruiru11嫁接至SL植株上，既可利用SL发达的根系，又能获得Ruiru11的高产高抗病性；由于嫁接Ruiru11日益普及，如今肯尼亚大小农场都混种着Ruiru11与SL品种。随着SL树龄老化，更多农庄正转向Ruiru11（或嫁接方案），因其易管理且抗病性强。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Ruiru11的谱系构成比较复杂，它的父系血脉来源于两个方向：1-具有抗病能力的\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Rume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；母系血脉的考量是好打理的矮株和可以较高的种植密度，以及抗病性，最终一小部分Catimor被筛选出来作为母系血脉；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 17px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             Batian 巴天或者巴蒂安，这是肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI）2010年推出的新品种，以肯尼亚山最高峰命名，兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，还具有两年即可结果的早熟优势。虽然因植株结构等问题尚未大规模推广，但其普及度正在上升。\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             Batian是从Ruiru11的父系植株的第五代里筛选出来的，所以它的基因组成即是：\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n               1-具有抗病能力的\n              </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                Rume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；\n               </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             关于处理\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            在肯尼亚，处理过程简要如下：\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            - 咖农采收鲜果\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            - 采收当天，运送到处理厂；（摩托车，自行车，人力背运都有）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            - 在处理厂，先将鲜果做挑选；当处理厂的质量员批准后才可计重算作售卖；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            -很多小农的鲜果会集中一批进行去皮处理\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            -去皮后的带着果胶的咖啡豆静置发酵（无水）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            -隔天进行水槽中的刷洗\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            -二次浸泡（根据每个处理厂的习惯，可能有不同质量等级的做二次浸泡或者不做）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            -搬运至晒床晾晒\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            -晾晒约2周左右，收储到处理厂的仓库中\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SUmFynsJ8mZibzFwhDyicticjFTXlrJpJcjxiaqDStcT9MwwM2lMkcO9cZksLTz9doiaPlp0z12qhicDzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU4MDQ4MDQ5OA==&amp;mid=2247483997&amp;idx=6&amp;sn=a18ff433ea7f792d4e6a6f3627f6b9d0&amp;chksm=fd577ec0ca20f7d6e696cf212cc39d2ba6d9b0a4a328ad712cc033336dbb1cd22f159001340d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             更详细的内容可以参考文章 产区 | 肯尼亚\n            </span>\n</a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏淘宝店铺哦～\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" styl